WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:05.110
Either way, this is ludicrous.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.860
How dare a depraved
murderer speak of gods!

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.100
Damn it!

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.350
I'm always the one who
gets stuck apologizing!

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.500
And I didn't do a flippin'
thing wrong, either.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.870
Sosuke's got everyone fooled
with that nice-guy face of his.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.290
Sosuke!

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:03.670
A Promise

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:00.890
Sosuke!

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.290
Shino! Don't...!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:04.520
Stay back!

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.890
Is that your little god?

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:11.360
Indeed, he doesn't appear
to be of much use.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:16.570
So!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.240
Shino...!

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:21.230
I told you to stay back.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.660
Why...? What gives?!

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:24.900
"Why?"

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:27.730
That is what I would like to know!

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.790
Why did you slaughter my family?

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.040
They were killed...?

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.380
You killed them just two years ago!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:37.300
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.300
Your ignorance rings false.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.680
Or...

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.060
...have you killed too
many to remember?!

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.520
Who the hell have you confused him with?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.260
I'm the one confused?

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.490
I will never forget...
that voice or that face.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.070
Not to mention that smell!

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.950
Neither of you smell human.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:08.210
You're just like that man!

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:15.320
Where did you obtain that-
that artificial life?

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:20.270
She's strong!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:29.730
Shino!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.390
This farce is over.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.650
Now show me your true form!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:47.640
A dog...?

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.350
He's...

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.380
a dog?!

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:00.400
That's bullshit!

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:01.430
Asakeno!

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.510
You may stop right there.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:07.260
This is not the man you think he is.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.100
Kokonoe, but-!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.260
You have an unfortunate tendency
to jump to conclusions.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.480
At the very least,

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:20.320
I have the feeling that your guy
was not such a ridiculous creature.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:24.780
Shino, I think that she just insulted me
without batting an eye.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:25.660
Keep quiet.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.700
Murasame, huh? Who is this child...?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.450
It would seem that my child
has caused you grief.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.460
I am sorry.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:42.300
As a sign of my apology,
I will do anything you ask of me.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.050
Kokonoe?!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.180
Then go find somethin' for me.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.300
What is it?

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:51.030
It's a small ball on Stashed Mountain
that says "Duty" on it.

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:54.270
Shino...

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.890
People cannot set foot
on that mountain...

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.820
...but that's not beyond you, is it?

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.890
As you wish.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.450
Talk about tough luck.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.950
That hottie nearly killed ya.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.650
You were watching?

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:14.960
Yeah, after all the noise you made.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.960
Oh, I don't wanna hear,
"You shoulda helped if you were watching!"

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:21.580
I can't imagine anyone
actually doing ya in.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:25.430
And I'll always side with
a babe over a doggie.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.290
No surprise there.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.310
I won't say a thing.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:30.970
Huh?

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.710
Hey, isn't that...?

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:36.090
Oh, my scar? It's from a long time ago.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.120
No, that's not what I meant.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:42.230
Doesn't Shino have a mark on his right arm
identical to yours?

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.650
Yeah, and doesn't Genpachi have one
on his right cheek?

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.570
I've got one, too!

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:48.870
Huh?

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:51.740
It's not exactly somewhere
I can show most people.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.000
Wanna quick look-see?

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.000
No! Why are you taking off your pants?!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.540
C'mon! Check it out.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:03.050
It's horrible, Akane baby!
An out-right disaster!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.760
Gawd, you're having morning
coffee with Lt. Inukai?!

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:09.260
When the blazes did you
two grow so close?!

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:09.800
Excuse me?

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.640
Grrr! I'm so jealous!

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.020
Let's hear what you came to say.
Grrr! I'm so jealous!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.810
Right! About that!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.400
The entire village is in an uproar!

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.430
They're insistent on climbing Stashed Mountain.

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:21.140
What?!

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:23.850
Here's the root of the problem.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:28.770
The boy forgot his jacket and this came
tumbling out of its pocket.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.690
This is gold. Real gold.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:35.250
Shino, where did you
get your hands on that?

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:36.410
Does it really matter?

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.280
I'd say you got it
from Stashed Mountain.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:39.980
And if I did?

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.820
That mountain was originally
covered in gold mines.

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:45.420
Akane, you know all
about that, don't you?

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:49.880
Yeah, but the pollution
derived from the hazardous

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.170
effluent by refining too much
gold proved devastating.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:55.650
People were unable to return to
this land until 50 years ago.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:07:00.080
Supposedly both the land and
underground water were clean by then.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.420
Ah, so that's why

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:09.020
that mountain is the only place
blessed with stashed rain.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.620
It has taken many long years to purify

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.420
the sullied mountain and water.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:20.370
Why did you show this little bundle
of trouble to the villagers?

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.210
I'm sorry. A military
police officer saw it...

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.120
And then the villagers found out...

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:27.420
The fools...

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.430
Have they forgotten about the five men

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:30.800
who died after going up the mountain?

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.930
But remember what you said, Akane?!

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.190
We'll be fine as long as we

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:36.210
don't drink the same
water as those five men!

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:38.720
I never said that Stashed
Mountain was safe!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:40.980
If you'd like a warning...

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.930
Why is that mountain the
only place to see rain?

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.600
Why can't people step
foot on that mountain?

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.180
There is a legitimate reason for both.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:54.560
There is...?

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.360
If they understand why and
still insist on going,

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.730
I won't get in their way.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.680
This child... Does he know
about the monkey spirit?

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.630
The monkey spirit on Stashed Mountain

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.010
loves children, if you can believe that!

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:14.510
He played with both
me and my grandmother

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:17.640
back when we were young'uns.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:23.550
But once you're an adult,
you mustn't approach that mountain.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.170
Children and beasts are the only ones

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:28.020
allowed entry onto that mountain.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.780
I was thinking about naming you Asahi.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.280
Monkey Spirit, what do you think?

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:37.230
Asahi... Good name.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.090
Give me name.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:43.070
Oh, right! "Monkey Spirit"
isn't actually a name, is it?

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:47.250
Then I'll give you a
name, too, Monkey Spirit!

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:50.460
Don't forget it, no matter what!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.170
You seem to be in a rather foul mood.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:02.430
Your ball goes missing, we get locked up,
and then you get hurt.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:03.720
This whole trip sucks!

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.820
You only have yourself to blame.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:07.190
Please think on that.

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:11.300
Damn it! Someday I'm
gonna let her have it.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:12.440
Let who have it?

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.820
That manly woman weirdo from yesterday!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.410
Oh? So now I'm weird?

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.410
She's here!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.210
Enjoying your position of power, Shino?

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:22.320
Forcing Kokonoe to do your bidding!

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:23.790
You're one to talk!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.290
How dare you show your face
after slashing at Sosuke like that?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.710
Sosuke, say something!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.090
Hello.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.820
Don't greet the freak...

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:33.980
Uh, wasn't your name Asakeno?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:37.090
Call me Keno. I'm Keno Inusaka.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.700
What do you want?

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.970
Kokonoe was furious at me
over what happened yesterday.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.930
She insisted that I
offer a proper apology.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.700
After mulling over it, I
realized that killer would

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:49.100
never stoop so low as to
become this runt's servant.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.360
Sorry. I apologize, sort of.

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:53.900
Who're you calling a runt?! Well?!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.360
That's what has you upset, Shino?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.870
Do you know what exactly that woman is?

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.450
Kokonoe saved my life.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:05.870
She is both a mother
and elder sister to me.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:08.540
What more could I possibly need to know?

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:10.380
Nothing...

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:14.320
An evil spirit saved your life, huh?

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.130
That little dear's life
has come to an end.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:23.280
Time has passed like the flow of sand.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.070
I cannot even hold onto the tiny life

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:28.990
that should have been
in the palm of my hand.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.900
I have waited countless years.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:37.740
Yet the girl who made that
promise has failed to return.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.330
I always find that I am left
behind before I know it.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:46.910
It cannot be helped. You are a god.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.920
What... is a god?

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.700
Even those dear to me
have left me behind.

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:59.090
I can no longer recall what
I am supposed to protect.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.430
My very existence...

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.750
...may have outlived its purpose.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.160
You want that child
to show you the way?!

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:12.150
I won't have it!

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.440
If you're dead set on
going, go by yourselves!

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.940
Don't drag a child down with you!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:21.990
Doc, you don't get how desperate
everyone in the village is.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.380
Your grandma may have
lived in our village,

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:27.950
but you're still just an
outsider who moved in.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.460
You'd best not get the wrong idea.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.750
You are the outsiders who moved in!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.760
What was that supposed to mean?

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:44.550
The Saiki house originally
hailed from this land.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:50.200
They were famous goldsmiths
for generation upon generation,

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:53.770
dating back to the days when
Stashed Mountain was a goldmine.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:58.280
It was even said that,
"Gods reside within the Saikis' golden art."

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:02.290
Mayhap that be why a Saiki woman has

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:04.920
always lived here, serving
as a local guardian.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:08.290
Just as the doctor's grandmother did...

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.540
Dear Doctor, The villagers kidnapped us.
~Shino

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.540
The villagers kidnapped us.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.740
Those ignorant fools!

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.790
Just as those five dead men said,

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:31.480
the rain let up the second
we reached the mountain.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:32.750
Our compass is useless, too.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.950
Kiddo, be sure to tell us the way.

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.940
Why'd they bring us?

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:41.570
Hey, didn't we just pass by that tree?

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.360
You're right.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:44.590
Hey, damn brat!

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:46.070
Are you taking us down the right path?

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.910
I let you know that this was
impossible from the get-go.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:50.450
And there aren't any paths to lead you!

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:52.940
Then that's that.

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:55.460
We'll just have to keep heading up.

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:56.380
Yeah.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.420
Last time, we were able to get through
when it was just us adults.

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:03.860
You're with us today, so why are
we running into problems?

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:05.470
We won't get anywhere today.

00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:06.470
Why not?

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.680
Because the monkey spirit said
that humans aren't allowed up here.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:11.940
The monkey spirit?

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:13.980
You mean the one
who treated you so kindly?

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:17.670
Yup. Today we're trapped in his barrier,

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:19.480
so we can't move ahead or pull back.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:22.380
What?! Does that mean we're trapped?

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:23.960
Shino!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.240
The lady doc-

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.370
Something... just broke.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:35.870
He broke the barrier, didn't he?

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:37.330
He most certainly did.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.880
And he made it look easy.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.090
Don't break the barrier!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.460
I'm blind in the dark.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:43.880
That's irrelevant!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:45.640
It's raining!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.970
Just what I'd expect
of Stashed Mountain!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.970
Just imagine if we could bring this water
down to the village.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:54.060
And if we find gold,
we could even relocate!

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.140
That won't happen.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:56.020
Huh?

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.580
He found ya before you could
accomplish any of that.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:05.040
Th-the monkey spirit!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.640
The man-eating monkey spirit...

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:28.740
But the last time I
saw the monkey spirit,

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:31.300
he wasn't emanating
an air of such intense

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.810
insanity that it felt outright sinister.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.820
Damn that crow!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.070
How dare he leave me behind!

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.280
And where did all of
this rain come from?

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.230
A monkey?

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.130
It's dead...

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.510
Going by the rate of decomposition,
it died about a week ago...

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:05.550
A ring...? Are you Asahi?!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:11.970
You won't get lonesome if you keep
Asahi around. I just know it.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:13.790
Lonesome...?

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:19.380
Grandma died, so I won't
be coming back next summer.

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.300
This is Grandma's ring.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:25.580
I heard it was made out of the gold

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:27.210
from this mountain a long time ago.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.280
Women from the Saiki house

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:31.770
always wear this gold
when they get married.

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.160
Asahi, please hold onto this for me.

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:36.390
I'll be back!

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.450
I'm sure that the monkey spirit

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.000
won't feel lonely if you stay with him.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.930
Please stay with him until I get back.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.880
Please don't leave his side.

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:48.570
Asahi...

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.770
Are you done bidding farewell?

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.500
May you rest in peace.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.170
Duty

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:27.960
Be gone!

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.220
Whoa! What now?!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:34.640
Crap!

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:35.680
Murasame!

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:53.950
Hey, are you trying to
destroy this mountain?!

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:58.450
Everything I'm meant
to protect... is gone!

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:01.910
What'll you do when
this mountain is gone?

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:07.460
Return to the earth, like everyone else.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.090
Remove that!

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:14.590
Are you going to support
the mountain in my stead?!

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:15.640
Shino!

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:16.930
Keep outta this!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.850
Sorry, but unlike you,
I've still got people

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.600
in this world whom I care about!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.980
I'm not gonna become the pillar
that supports this place!

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.250
That promise...

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:35.360
I wish I never made
that accursed promise!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.370
Stop being an idiot!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.120
A human child gave me a name!

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:48.370
I'll obey only the will of that child!

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:51.170
What?! Who's the kid?

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:56.180
That child made a promise
with me that she never kept.

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.640
Who the hell is it?! Who's
that nasty scumbag?!

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.610
Were you referring to me?

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.140
Wha-?!

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.640
Sorry I took so long.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:08.740
But I'm here now,

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:13.220
Shinonome!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.210
What?

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:20.030
Have you grown so senile
that you forgot your own name?

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:24.660
And here Asahi never once forgot
the promise we shared.

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.600
He lovingly wore that
ring this whole time.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:30.670
Kokonoe...!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.670
I found what you were looking for.

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.220
Really?

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:40.180
Doc, apparently the monkey spirit
won't listen to anyone but you.

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.960
Please talk some sense into him.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.680
Nah, there's nothing to say.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:47.900
What?!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:52.120
If he wants to flatten this
mountain, then he should.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.940
Isn't he free to do as he wishes?

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:56.190
Uh, seriously, Doc?

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:58.240
There is no need for you

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.820
to share your water and
gold with greedy humans.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.410
I can't believe this lady doctor...!

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:05.200
But...

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.710
...I'm glad I got to see you again.

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:13.660
By the time my dreams came true
and I returned as a doctor,

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.750
I had already become an adult.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.840
Normally, adults cannot
enter this mountain.

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:24.110
I'm glad I got to see you, Shinonome.

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:49.370
I imagine the next person
you meet will be my future child.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:56.640
The group that entered the mountain
still hasn't returned, Doctor!

00:19:57.260 --> 00:19:58.840
There are some who say that they

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.010
left together with the outsiders
who're staying here.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:03.810
They must have been mistaken.

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:07.640
They've been here ever since morning.

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:11.630
In the end, we didn't find any gold
or a new water source.

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:14.400
And I don't see it raining
anytime this year...

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.080
Stashed Mountain will remain unchanged.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.360
There is no need for it to change.

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:26.660
Huh? Where are you two headed?

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:30.310
Every now-and-then we need
to put in a good deed.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:32.670
We're the demons of justice!

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:34.740
Okay...

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:52.480
Aren't they the demons Fuki and Raiki?

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:57.660
Still, I can't help but wonder why that

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:59.410
woman went to Stashed Mountain...

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:00.940
Supposedly the woman on

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.250
the mountain left some water with Asahi.

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:06.570
She claimed that the water
could grant his wish.

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:09.060
The monkey spirit...

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:12.450
never seemed to
realize what Asahi's wish was.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.280
Someday, will I...

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:22.460
Will I have to face the
day when I am alone,

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:25.590
Duty
Devotion

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:25.600
dreaming of an unfulfilled
promise I made with someone?

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:29.010
Shino!

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:32.850
We won't make the train
if we don't hurry.

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.350
Right! I'm on my way.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:37.360
Oh, right! I just remembered something.

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:38.020
Here!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:38.950
Whoa!

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:41.480
What's this?

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:47.610
You had this on you the whole time?

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:48.910
It's your turn to look after it.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:50.410
I'm leaving!

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:52.120
Wait for me!

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:53.490
Don't leave me behind!

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:41.020
Encounter

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:30.340
Say, Kokonoe.
Does Asakeno have a boyfriend?

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:31.890
A boyfriend? Why do you ask?

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:36.520
Well, if she doesn't, then maybe
I could be a candidate?

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:37.590
Goodness, me!

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:40.600
Huh? Did I hit your funny bone?
